,"full_text":"石川県、富山県で発生した線状降水帯の影響により、北陸地方で大雨となっており、本日（２７日）６時２０分以降、石川県の４市町（羽咋市、志賀町、宝達志水町、中能登町）、富山県の１市（氷見市）にレベル５大雨特別警報が発表され、警戒を要する状況となっております。","id_str":"2092736968060961221","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","quote_count":14,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":486,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"1182556649120075776"},"note_tweet":{"is_expandable":true,"note_tweet_results":{"result":{"entity_set":{"hashtags":[],"smarttags":[],"symbols":[],"urls":[],"user_mentions":[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwOTI3MzY5NjgwMjMzMjY3MjA=","richtext":{"richtext_tags":[]},"text":"石川県、富山県で発生した線状降水帯の影響により、北陸地方で大雨となっており、本日（２７日）６時２０分以降、石川県の４市町（羽咋市、志賀町、宝達志水町、中能登町）、富山県の１市（氷見市）にレベル５大雨特別警報が発表され、警戒を要する状況となっております。\n陸自第１０師団（愛知）をはじめ、自衛隊は各地において情報収集態勢を強化しております。"}}},"rest_id":"2092736968060961221","source":"<a href=\"https://mobile.twitter.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter Web App</a>","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"256458","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}},"user_id_str":"268732024"},"rest_id":"2092771252272542085","source":"<a href=\"http://twitter.com/#!/download/ipad\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter for iPad</a>","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"3714","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2092771252272542085","sortIndex":"2092912418958081939"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","cashtag_attachments":[],"core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":3},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/996639601262452736/4RIAr7j3_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2904127170/1526452282"},"core":{"created_at":"Wed Nov 19 05:03:34 +0000 2014"